datasets/
gaussian-splatting/output/
**/iteration_*/

# --- Environment & Binaries ---
# Ignore the SIBR viewer and its massive DLLs
.vscode/

# --- Python & System Junk ---
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
.env
.vscode/
